{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0373_1000_null", "source_sha256": "133c52ae52c512d63ef0b2e464541fc2e9eb42fd344fd4a24aa7b8c6d9d0ae31", "ja": "―765PRO ALLSTARS TOUR 開演直前―", "zh": "—765PRO ALLSTARS TOUR 开演前夕—", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0373_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "591808a5259f72a8c959a7b09e46e369a1128bc49a5202695e626ed3ef6ba6f0", "ja": "プロデューサーさん。\nとうとう、始まっちゃいますね。", "zh": "制作人。\n终于要开始了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0373_1002_402cpr", "source_sha256": "7f0f2347248160900a60a8c0534bf766ab65b9dc221ae743b69faeebc1b2b76e", "ja": "ああ。新しいメンバーでの第一歩……。\nやり残したことはないか？", "zh": "啊。以新成员组成的队伍迈出的第一步……  \n还有没有什么没做完的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0373_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "064640e3096f7504c1d75cd3cb869db08502e9c897747ded581ec74bc18bc15a", "ja": "はい♪　さっき全員に声もかけましたから。\n「絶対大丈夫」「一緒に頑張ろうね」、", "zh": "好♪我刚才也已经和所有人打过招呼了。  \n“绝对没问题”、“一起加油吧”、", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0373_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "7da29961f9c0bde461b8aae999d0c4871665d8b14c0d69d48c3c4376b55aaccd", "ja": "「思いっきり楽しもうね！」って。", "zh": "还有“痛痛快快地享受吧！”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0373_1005_402cpr", "source_sha256": "0c735abb39544b26a08f486964fe0bc5c3d5ba0c0f367b9fcf443603c2a573de", "ja": "助かるよ。\nさすが、頼りになる先輩だな。", "zh": "帮大忙了。\n不愧是前辈，真是可靠。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0373_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "fc585bed283e65855396a92c448070214fccb546a74b0a8bdf35c4ad92408523", "ja": "あっ、いえ、全然そういうのじゃなくて！\n私はただ、本当に楽しみなだけで。", "zh": "啊，不是的，完全不是那回事！\n我只是，真的很期待而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0373_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "cb3c32186d238bbb8574974bf12036249806c451b494da039fbc289cc59d94d8", "ja": "今日のために集まって、一緒に頑張ってきたメンバー、\nやっと全員一緒にステージに立てるんだ～って。", "zh": "为了今天聚集在一起、共同努力至今的成员们，终于能全员一起站上舞台了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0373_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "7d3a1892579ccd1a55db7eeea3e90e2b39fc905195f2ccee2d5d4bf31b401c59", "ja": "だから、始まる前にみんなの顔が見たくなって。\nそれで会いに行っただけなんです。", "zh": "所以，我想在开始前看看大家的脸。就只是去见大家而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0373_1009_402cpr", "source_sha256": "7d9d612aca2a412a6c81eddd29229dc9f6c4cb06ea8bb37fde545868dc683e1e", "ja": "でも、初ステージに緊張してる新人からしたら、\n落ち着いた先輩の笑顔は心強かっただろうな。", "zh": "不过，对因首次登台而紧张的新人来说，沉着的前辈的笑容一定让她很安心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0373_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "ca10c6537aa9a3f0397f8e9dcece7da1ff5c8c0b7deb5d533a64a20f27f25b77", "ja": "そうなのかな……？\nそうだといいんですけど♪", "zh": "是这样吗……？\n要真是那样就好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0373_1011_402cpr", "source_sha256": "40b161a97e56fa802244fe2d7649572ad9df8167e2e63c2fb0cd253671be9ec6", "ja": "それにしても、まず楽しみなことが、\n『全員一緒にステージに立てること』か……。", "zh": "话说回来，最期待的事情是“所有人一起站上舞台”吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0373_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "e4e61bc661d3c445289940b273671315bba94dc66ac86bb6ce89e2811a69c09c", "ja": "？　あ、もしかして、ダメでした？", "zh": "？啊，难道不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0373_1013_402cpr", "source_sha256": "b7de9457c4230e4be272bbb2bd287efdc4bfa446b9b3cbe521135cc5efb30b0d", "ja": "いや、春香らしくていいと思うよ。さ、もう時間だ。\n自分らしく、メンバー全員で一緒に楽しんでこい！", "zh": "不，我觉得很有春香的风格，很好啊。好，时间到了。\n保持自己的风格，大家一起好好享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0373_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "c07cec5192ff0ae5c3508de0fa4359eb7a2299e4585b6dcbde8328780ab86c03", "ja": "はいっ、全員で一緒に楽しんできます♪\n私は私らしく！　……えへへっ♪", "zh": "好，一起和大家尽情享受吧♪\n我会做我自己！……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
